              "answer": "tum",
              "why": "t only comes after a voiceless consonant, and *oku-* ends in a vowel."
            },
            {
              "answer": "yorum",
              "why": "*Okuyorum* is **I am reading**. Yesterday needs the past: *okudum*."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "explain": "*oku-* + *-du* + *-m*: the vowel follows the u of the stem."
